# §22.5 #7b wilderness-priest-rebirth: pin both arms of the rebirth
# alive-vs-dead branch in one fixture. Slot 1 priest at lv 5 (post-knob
# wi = seed 67 + 8×4 = 99, ma cap = 99) just covers rebirth's cost
# (base 90 + lv 5 = 95). Slot 3 starts dead via RYL_FORCE_DEAD_SLOT
# so the second cast lands the dead arm without a combat detour.
#
# Cast order matters: alive arm first (no ma debit by design — legacy
# quirk preserved verbatim), then dead arm (debits 95 ma). Reversed
# order would leave ma at 4 < 95 and trip the not_enough_pts gate on
# the second cast.
RYL_FAKE_EPOCH=1700000000
RYL_FAKE_SEED=2
RYL_NO_DELAY=1
RYL_FORCE_PARTY_LV=5
RYL_FORCE_DEAD_SLOT=3
